OL,3,GNEWSAReading for pleasure can improve
OL,4,Awellbeing - study
OL,5,
OL,6,FReading for pleasure can improve health
OL,7,Fand wellbeing at any age and regardless
OL,8,Fof what you read, University of
OL,9,FCambridge academics have said.
OL,11,FProfessor Barbara Sahakian and Dr
OL,12,FChristelle Langley, from the
OL,13,Funiversity's department of psychiatry,
OL,14,Fargued that reading boosts mental
OL,15,Fhealth and academic performance,
OL,16,Fleading to greater empathy and lowering
OL,17,Fthe risk of dementia.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
