OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAReading for pleasure can improve
OL,4,Awellbeing - study
OL,5,
OL,6,FTheir review, published in the journal
OL,7,FPsychological Medicine, found reading
OL,8,Fat any age improves brain and mental
OL,9,Fhealth, enhances cognitive performance
OL,10,Fand reduces the risk of mental decline.
OL,12,FSahakian added that "it's never too
OL,13,Flate to start" reading, as "it can
OL,14,Fbring benefits throughout our lives and
OL,15,Finto old age".
